  "project_description": "This module is a clone of User history that tracks only a few of the base user entity fields, plus any of the custom fields added via the field UI that have been selected in the settings.\n\n The major difference is that it provides a full UI for creating, updating, and deleting user_annex entities.\n\n A new user_annex entity is created every time a user entity is updated with a change in one of the tracked fields.",
